mantic but a wonderful place for groups and families. The service was quite good too.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cuapm","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8tj18","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aqjbr","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6v9ie","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c68t","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"10. Snorkeling off Molokini","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ftrld","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5b91i","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"2q8ai","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_4b461e17bb0e45d0beaa582cee22c80e~mv2_d_4160_2340_s_2.jpg"},"width":4160,"height":2340},"altText":"Molokini"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"18s24","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Snorkeling off Molokini was one of the most memorable things about Maui for all of us. If you can afford to do this I really recommend it. We had an amazing time with our guides and our captain, Don Burns, aboard the Seafire. Check them out at ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"www.molokinisnorkeling.com ","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"They are safe, reputable and great with kids and families.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"704lc","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4b9l6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5jcp8","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Our guides were very knowledgeable about the wildlife and the island history giving us a lot of information and allowing everyone plenty of time for questions. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4lo7a","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8jgiv","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"If you have never been snorkeling before, they have all the equipment you need, they will teach you everything you need to know and help you every step of the way so you have a safe and exciting adventure. If you need a prescriptive mask you can rent equipment from Snorkel Bob's. They are everywhere on Maui. Departures are from Kihei, HI.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6krl1","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"75v4v","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"duvog","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_d7beb4069f924a52a4043b9e1fc9bea4~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Sunrise over Haleakala"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_83ad1956c63846439f38310aba400d44~mv2_d_4160_2340_s_2.jpg"},"width":4160,"height":2340}},"title":"snorkeling at Molokini"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_5e908544cd724321958c2a332e5328c7~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Ohana means Family"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_5dd7ebfdde8e49d6b50fa16e2d1bb8fe~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"For the Birds"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_829b84529c7a4c258a621446c0946c5d~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"For the Birds"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_2dce099e567b4f758ca2885d70609ba9~mv2_d_3024_4032_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":3024,"height":4032}},"title":"Molokini (Backside)"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_a4f54525134449e3877e3b9b1ba61879~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Molokini (backside)"}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"FULLSIZE","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":3},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"VIDEO","id":"9kis6","nodes":[],"videoData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"video":{"src":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fjvp5z0ArIk"}},"thumbnail":{"src":{"url":"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Fjvp5z0ArIk/mqdefault.jpg"},"width":626,"height":352}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1kqsg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"On our way  back to shore from Molokini we fed these little birds a few bread crumbs and they followed us all of the way back to Kehei boat launch! They are so cute!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d05cg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8r0hf","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cu5jg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2cbdk","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7isnj","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" 11. Enjoy your accommodations","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2mlkm","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bitmn","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"788rn","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_288943d7b5d540eea39d8c5e0ff4b682~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"Hale Mahina, Maui"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2m9n7","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dvc4g","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"This is where our three families rented condos from the local owners. These condos and many other condo complexes in the area rent through VRBO, Home Away, Air B&B and other services when the owners are not staying in them. We really enjoy using these services when we travel. So far we have had wonderful experiences in the homes and condos that we have rented. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4gpmg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aviqv","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Hale Mahina Condo complex is a very special place indeed! We were all very happy with our rentals and had great experiences here.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cg88c","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5ca5o","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Every afternoon we gathered together for some beach time here at Hale Mahina, relaxing by the pool and hot tub that were very well maintained and enjoying the grounds filled with amazing tropical flowers at every turn. The kids played in the sand and we saw sea turtles swimming in the water and climbing up on the beach. Several coconuts floated up on the surf too. That was oddly interesting to see!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9knlo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3jsbn","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We talked about the days events and made plans for dinner until the sun was nearly set. Then it was time for pictures and a conch ceremony performed each night by an owner who happened to be there the week we visited. (video below)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bqi3c","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5qc1b","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fud8u","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"96i4l","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_cb609a6dbc0f4fc89fbe150200a451a3~mv2_d_4160_2340_s_2.jpg"},"width":4160,"height":2340}},"title":"The Rainbow"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_878d888166aa4edd86b90e95eb3d1834~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Garden"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_f9f75a09edb64c17a62c0c08f753a35f~mv2_d_3150_2104_s_2.jpg"},"width":3150,"height":2104}},"title":"Sea Turtle"