t":"16. Have Brunch at \"The Gazebo\" Napili Shores Condo Complex, West Maui.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ddatr","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"d1ne5","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_ae3d0e7e0cb14a52a630e0aae559c14c~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"The Gazebo, Napili, West Maui"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6i5ee","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"eiuna","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_5c7f04a532ad4bf7bee9f9f33fb34905~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"The Gazebo, Napili West Maui"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ra43","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"This is a fabulous place for brunch! Check them out on Yelp","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" HERE.","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.yelp.com/biz/gazebo-restaurant-lahaina","target":"BLANK"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" We had a large party and needed to be split up again but that was all right. Table space at this place is really at a premium! We did a little shopping at the gift shop outside while we waited. It's a lovely location and it really didn't seem that long although I think we did wait around 40 minutes to be seated. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5gktb","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dimm6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The service was great despite the crowd and the food is wonderful. We didn't feel rushed either.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bn3vq","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"85vqg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Try the Banana Pancakes and the Fried Rice! Wow!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"elpla","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6nin6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5q5js","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"at8vu","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ffg04","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"17. Take the back road to Hana, Pilani Highway","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bpdnn","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"an8ap","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_9799e9ace6bb47f7baa388a89df42a48~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"Pilani Highway"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7k7ua","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"It's possible to make a loop of Haleakala instead of driving the same road to Hana and then back again. We took the Piilana Highway up to the Maui Winery again and then continued on around the island from there. There are a few small sections that are not paved and one fairly lengthy spot that is something like cobblestone and extremely bumpy but none of it was impassable for our small car. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9p6ek","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aomou","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"I've heard some rental agency's will tell you that you can't take a rental car to Hana but absolutely everyone does. There was literally no one on the road all in the morning and we arrived at Hana in time be one of the first few tables for lunch at Hana Ranch Restaurant. We had truly beautiful outdoor seating and service was wonderful. We had a fresh tuna poke appetizer and burgers that were very well prepared. It was interesting to stop there as we had just passed the actual Hana Ranch on our way into Hana from the southwest. It's a very large and scenic place.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"agg54","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"35i7s","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dbjuq","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We love off the beaten path road trips and this was certainly just such a drive. It was so gorgeous and the weather was perfect. There is nothing else quite like this drive anywhere on the island.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d66hu","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"co5ue","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_b64ac58dc6a04f9096a147f521ea09bf~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Piilani Hwy looking West"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_9799e9ace6bb47f7baa388a89df42a48~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Piilani Hwy, Maui HI"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_eb7f6c55f92b4e06b10194e08cdcaf21~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Piilani Hwy"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_183ace3d56fd47c89275634e8f3c9749~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Looking South"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_f38baa600215404cbf24f2fc9676285f~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Heading East"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_28dbb6b127234632bf2419a17bb1ccab~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"South end of Maui"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_945a40551a1e4fe1ba44a41c6767858c~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Black Sand Beach"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_0640999f24a34298b01a6633255e515d~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"A church on the south end of Maui"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_55ce9fd24f4f407ca85842caf0485211~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Piilani Hwy, Maui HI"}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"FULLSIZE","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":3},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"23vuk","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d49v6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ekcg4","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"65eek","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5lmft","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" 18.  Drive the Hana Highway from Kalepa Bridge to Kahului.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"b1iab","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5f5e4","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"fj9pd","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_1fbb44b596ea41369a04cf9a1b69d124~mv2_d_2750_1831_s_2.jpg"},"width":2750,"height":1831},"altText":"Kalepa Bridge"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"br9ns","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"VIDEO","id":"51ee4","nodes":[],"videoData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"video":{"src":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMpWfRwcI0c"}},"thumbnail":{"src":{"url":"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jMpWfRwcI0c/mqdefault.jpg"},"width":626,"height":470}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8tk2b","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The scenery begins to change here from the dry side of the island to the luscious tropical rain forest of the east side as we round the southern tip of Maui. This is where The Seven Sacred Pools are. When we passed by, they were not allowing people to swim here anymore but you could enter the park and walk around for $25.00 per car. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a0h16","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"amfvo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Just before entering Hana we passed by the beautiful Hana Ranch. I presume that's where the beef for our lunch came from. Hana was actually bigger than we thought it might be. It's very picturesque and has several places to eat, a small museum and a tiny bit of shopping. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"33se0","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bqsuu","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dknbd","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dam86","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"All along the Hana highway from Hana to Kahului you will find small roadside family owned places to stop for a beverage or a bite. You will also notice how much more water there is!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5rplk","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"70nee","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"eq3mo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"7uvtf","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_895033ac04af4af1b3470337c171bef5~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"On the Road to Hana"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_c8b270b2cc764d8287af7ce016de28eb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Black Sand beach"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_7b5699056b314a9582c866dac40e574e~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Black Sand Beach"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_12e8e215afb84a04853aa25c4bbc2ca2~mv2_d_3937_2623_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":3937,"height":2623}},"title":"Hana Hwy, Maui HI"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_20c043db32114e348dcbad21ae4441f5~mv2_d_4027_2690_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4027,"height":2690}},"title":"Hana Hwy, Maui HI"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_eb8fb480af094e06993dbe036266d744~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"View from The Hana Ranch Restaurant"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_5fc38be085fb4d0cbf781020efa87168~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"A Church in Hana, Maui HI"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_a420c798256148f7a8b90c90cad9336d~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Nearing Kahului"}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"FULLSIZE","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":3},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8na12","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"pa3n","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d5p0k","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d7o4u","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7l788","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d8tr0","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"19. Cross beautiful narrow historic bridges along the Hana Highway.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"81jd0","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"8plml","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_d3b6e53efa7a49398dc286ae3caab23a~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"Historic Bridge, Hana Hwy"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a3pc2","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Hana Highway is narrow and passes over more bridges than we could count. They are all different and beautiful in their own way. Many are on corners and the corners are so sharp that it's common practice to blow your car's horn as you round the bend. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cgbjp","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1pkm5","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ag0h9","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"On our way back from Hana toward the middle of the island we passed rental car after rental car full of passengers hanging out of windows with selfie sticks trying to get the best picture of the oncoming corner, bridge and waterfall. It was great fun. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8o9aj","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ephie","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Keep in mind this road is very narrow and the bridges are even more so. Having a small car is helpful here. Often you need to yield to oncoming traffic and cross the bridges one at a time. Remember we're all on Hawaiian time here so please be courteous. Mahalo.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"b2luq","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6vb5q","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"13j5d","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_047d15cad56142bbb4ce4364e8bae5d3~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024},"altText":"Historic Bridge, Hana Hwy"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"agfeg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4pbfc","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ckq07","nodes":[{"type":"